{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Land Beneath Us is a turn-based rogue-lite action dungeon crawler. Use powerful skill combos and stylish weaponry to battle your way through the Underworld known as Annwn. Enjoy challenging dynamic encounters and discover the mysteries of this mythological world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE THROUGH THE UNDERWORLD!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forged by The Creator, the Ultimate Soul Harvester (U.S.H) is crafted to gather Souls. Now armed with Soul-Technology, its mission is one of redemption. Explore The Underworld, engage, barter, or confront characters. Learn from their tales to shape your unique path.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/48f89c7fd16002d32aff765574bed26c.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/48f89c7fd16002d32aff765574bed26c.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/48f89c7fd16002d32aff765574bed26c.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE COMBOS!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome enemies with powerful abilities, executing customizable movement combinations. Plan strategically through short, action-packed levels to maximize hits on creatures!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIED ARSENAL\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and wield a diverse array of weapons, from Blood Axes to Longinus Spears and Lazer Pistols. Equip different weapons in each slot for a dynamic hack 'n' slash journey through the Underworld.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/720e1841f84b87d645957c93e0fa528a.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/720e1841f84b87d645957c93e0fa528a.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/720e1841f84b87d645957c93e0fa528a.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY FACTOR\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance stats and abilities by collecting souls from defeated enemies as you explore each world. Enjoy direct combat? Boost your Weapon skill tree. Prefer a strategic approach? Unlock potent Combo Abilities to hit enemies from a distance.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/9316711c38514e8a5e9e995b9d9ccc30d3803d10.jpg"},{"name":"Mother's Soul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/b8e4537cd825d1c2f7ac67d7da6134ee9107b69b.jpg"},{"name":"The Chained Witch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/e10a296f3b97006f0521ba7e1740682231370c71.jpg"},{"name":"Venom Horseman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/861b93937e67e359bd8b42cd166dff4004ea3109.jpg"},{"name":"Under The Swamp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/51a0aaaaef26b54762ebc77bd8302b88c0f3e237.jpg"},{"name":"Trouble Trio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/7b448d57b8a6cb0ff0d73d163b7f98ee82249ce7.jpg"},{"name":"10\u201a000\u201a000 Volt Thunderbolt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/fded381dced548d231b98439ee2e6396a79a7cc0.jpg"},{"name":"Pride and Prejudgment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/97ce8675fa67c33615debadb370cb2b4c39f571d.jpg"},{"name":"Get Serious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/4d3f89fa42946c409f3ce5bca4e237f20662c2dd.jpg"},{"name":"Family Reunion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2131010/bc17a10ad982c4e761e9e6bdbb037d18b999fd93.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2131010?t=1763790530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763790530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763790530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763790530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2774660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Steam Deck Verified</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/2417db4c4b829b2afea1760c47698713.avif?t=1763790530\" width=610 height=198 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Land Beneath Us is a turn-based rogue-lite action dungeon crawler. Use powerful skill combos and stylish weaponry to battle your way through the Underworld known as Annwn. Enjoy challenging dynamic encounters and discover the mysteries of this mythological world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE THROUGH THE UNDERWORLD!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forged by The Creator, the Ultimate Soul Harvester (U.S.H) is crafted to gather Souls. Now armed with Soul-Technology, its mission is one of redemption. Explore The Underworld, engage, barter, or confront characters. Learn from their tales to shape your unique path.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/48f89c7fd16002d32aff765574bed26c.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/48f89c7fd16002d32aff765574bed26c.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/48f89c7fd16002d32aff765574bed26c.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE COMBOS!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome enemies with powerful abilities, executing customizable movement combinations. Plan strategically through short, action-packed levels to maximize hits on creatures!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/e75c8f95e056fb1207772c67f6e75deb.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIED ARSENAL\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and wield a diverse array of weapons, from Blood Axes to Longinus Spears and Lazer Pistols. Equip different weapons in each slot for a dynamic hack 'n' slash journey through the Underworld.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/720e1841f84b87d645957c93e0fa528a.poster.avif?t=1763790530\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/720e1841f84b87d645957c93e0fa528a.webm?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/extras/720e1841f84b87d645957c93e0fa528a.mp4?t=1763790530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY FACTOR\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance stats and abilities by collecting souls from defeated enemies as you explore each world. Enjoy direct combat? Boost your Weapon skill tree. Prefer a strategic approach? Unlock potent Combo Abilities to hit enemies from a distance.\u00a0</p>","developers":["FairPlay Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131010/header.jpg?t=1763790530","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2131010/699512/c2e2e9d395042110e117f3d8a54f42967a606b81/1751079923/dash_av1.mpd?t=1715601651","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2131010/699512/c2e2e9d395042110e117f3d8a54f42967a606b81/1751079923/dash_h264.mpd?t=1715601651","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2131010/699512/c2e2e9d395042110e117f3d8a54f42967a606b81/1751079923/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=171560165